(RATE-SENTINEL LOW LEVEL DESIGN \(LLD\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Version: 1.0) Tj
T*
(Date: 2026-07-16) Tj
T*
(Project: rate-sentinel) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. SCOPE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This LLD defines module-level and class-level design for key runtime capabilities:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- LLD-1: Rate limiting decision engine) Tj
T*
(- LLD-2: Authentication and security filter chain) Tj
T*
(- LLD-3: OTP generation and verification) Tj
T*
(- LLD-4: Idempotent payment processing) Tj
T*
(- LLD-5: Notification dispatch over Kafka) Tj
T*
(- LLD-6: Data model and persistence behavior) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. LLD-1: RATE LIMITING DECISION ENGINE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Primary classes:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `filter/RateLimitFilter.java`) Tj
T*
(- `service/RateLimitService.java`) Tj
T*
(- `algorithm/RateLimitAlgorithmFactory.java`) Tj
T*
(- `algorithm/SlidingWindowAlgorithm.java`) Tj
T*
(- `algorithm/TokenBucketAlgorithm.java`) Tj
T*
(- `algorithm/FixedWindowAlgorithm.java`) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.1 RESPONSIBILITIES) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `RateLimitFilter`) Tj
T*
(  - Resolve `clientId` \(request attribute from JWT or IP fallback\).) Tj
T*
(  - Skip exempt routes \(`/actuator`, `/api/auth`, `/favicon.ico`\).) Tj
T*
(  - Invoke service and write `X-RateLimit-*` headers.) Tj
T*
(  - Return 429 JSON body for denied requests.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `RateLimitService`) Tj
T*
(  - Resolve best matching rule using priority and pattern matching.) Tj
T*
(  - Use cache for rule lookup and fallback defaults when needed.) Tj
T*
(  - Delegate quota checks to selected algorithm strategy.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Algorithm implementations) Tj
T*
(  - `SlidingWindowAlgorithm`: high-accuracy windowing using Redis ZSET and atomic Lua script.) Tj
T*
(  - `TokenBucketAlgorithm`: burst-support with refill calculations.) Tj
T*
(  - `FixedWindowAlgorithm`: low-overhead counter per bucket.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.2 RULE SELECTION LOGIC) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Rule resolution order:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Exact \(`clientId`, `route`\)) Tj
T*
(2. Wildcard client \(`*`, `route`\)) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
